	(text "CAN and RS-485 bus sides, SELV side of the three digital isolators;\nEN floating = on (internal pull-up). 22 uH, 2 x 22 uF."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 130.57 85.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "06ac9963-7e29-54dc-b1a6-aa877951508f")
	)
	(text "S_FAN_PWM (isolated, 0/5 V) -> 4.7k / 2.2 uF -> S_FAN_VF: EN via 10k (off below 1.1-1.3 V: duty below\n~25 %, static low or a dead live side = fans OFF) and current injection into FB through 15.0k: higher duty =\nlower voltage (24 V ... 7 V); at a low input it runs in dropout. Rtop 100k / Rbot 2.87k."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 357.384 101.332 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2100d975-b6d7-5935-988e-90c184ac62c8")
	)
	(text "FAN 2"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 116.7328 113.832 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "27ce495f-3d6e-5e6d-b80c-931516d87bc2")
	)
	(text "SELV 5 V (TPS54360B, 500 KHZ)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 130.57 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "50bf79ed-9cff-5a65-b500-0be276b9ab98")
	)
	(text "1 M || 4.7 nF 1 kV plus SMBJ58CA: a common-mode surge on the field cables is clamped to PE; a solid\nPELV bond by the installer is harmless. Plated M3 hole = PE / shield bond near the terminals."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 229.606 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "50daaf1a-13b4-578d-a0c6-f485b1133f8d")
	)
	(text "AUX-T1 fan winding, cross-regulated: 12-36 V (sags to ~15 V without gate-bias load, PV-PWR). SMBJ36A\nclamp (36 V working), 2 x 10 uF 50 V. Both bucks have no under-voltage lock-out above 4.5 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 56.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "51f895f1-115e-5a85-a8c3-6f5fde6d9bbc")
	)
	(text "ENABLE (EXTERNAL STOP) AND STATUS TERMINAL"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 322.1984 113.832 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "63f96071-d0c1-55bc-947a-b665a05d0fde")
	)
	(text "1 S_EN_SRC (S_24V via 10k: dry-contact supply), 2 S_EN_IN (contact return or a PLC output), 3 STATUS\n(open drain 2N7002BK, conducting = healthy), 4 0 V. S_EN_IN -> 33k / 10k (5.1 V clamp, 100 nF: 0.77 ms)\n-> isolator: open contact, broken wire or lost SELV = STOP_OK low = latch set (no firmware)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 322.1984 174.822 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "67016bef-e562-556d-9155-4d7e457b34c1")
	)
